cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the GGSS method, please cite the paper below."
title: "GGSS: Geodesic-Gated Spherical Steering for Inference-Time Debiasing of Generative Vision-Language Models"
abstract: >-
  Official implementation of GGSS, an inference-time debiasing method for generative
  vision-language models. GGSS discovers a counterfactual demographic bias subspace on the unit
  hypersphere and steers visual token activations along geodesic arcs with an adaptive per-token
  gate, preserving activation norms and requiring no retraining of the underlying model.
